url: "https://github.com/bhagesh-h/methylarray"
abstract: >-
  methylarray is a Nextflow pipeline built from the nf-core template for
  Illumina Infinium DNA methylation arrays (EPIC v2). It runs sample and probe
  quality control, minfi, SeSAMe or ENmix preprocessing, blood cell-type
  composition, epigenetic clocks and DNA methylation scores, exploratory
  analysis, epigenome-wide association with limma, differentially methylated
  regions and gene set enrichment, and writes a MultiQC report and an HTML
  analysis report.
keywords:
  - DNA methylation
  - Illumina EPIC v2
  - methylation array
  - epigenome-wide association study
  - epigenetic clock
  - Nextflow
  - nf-core
